  "non_claims": [
    "Not an R1000 closure artifact and not a semantic or legal interpretation; R1000 stays active/unclosed.",
    "The counts document is a counts-only read of the materialized JSONL layers; it is NOT an independent substrate verification and NOT an authenticity claim.",
    "A partial run is never reported as full (partial_is_not_full=true).",
    "No raw decoded text reaches receipts, the report, diagnostics or stdout; every persisted string is a path, a hash, a count or a closed token.",
